  "For the rest of the turn, if a friendly **^^Stormcast Eternals^^** unit wholly within 12\" of this unit uses the 'All-out Defence' command, no command points are spent.": "",
  "Pick a friendly **^^Stormcast Eternals Hero^^** to be this unit's soul-bonded charge for the rest of the battle. This unit can use this ability while it is in reserve.": "",
  "Roll 2D6. If the result exceeds the target's Health characteristic, for the rest of the turn:\r\n• The target has **^^Strike-last^^**.\r\n• The target cannot use commands.": "",
  "If this unit charged this turn, for the rest of the turn, friendly **^^Stormcast Eternals^^** units have **^^Ward (5+)^^** while they are wholly within 12\" of this unit.": "",
  "Pick up to 3 friendly **^^Stormcast Eternals^^** units wholly within 12\" of this unit that were set up this turn using the 'Scions of the Storm' ability to be the targets.": "",
  "If the target is a friendly unit, it has **^^Strike-first^^** for the rest of the turn. If the target is an enemy unit, it has **^^Strike-last^^** for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "Roll a dice. On a 3+, add 1 to the Damage characteristic of this unit's **Companion** melee weapons for attacks that target enemy **^^Monsters^^** for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "When this unit uses the 'Power Through' command, inflict an additional D3 mortal damage on the target and add D6\" to the distance this unit can move as part of that ability": "",
  "If this unit charged this turn, pick an enemy unit in combat with both of the following units to be the target:\r\n• This unit.\r\n• A friendly unit that did not charge this turn.": "",
  "If this unit did not charge this turn and is in combat with an enemy unit that charged this turn, roll a dice. On a 4+, this unit has **^^Strike-first^^** for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "For the rest of the phase, when making charge rolls for the targets, add 1 to the number of dice rolled, then remove 1 dice of your choice and use the remaining dice as the charge roll.": "",
  "Until the start of your next turn, add 1 to the Rend characteristic of the target's melee weapons. If the chanting roll was 7+, you can pick another eligible unit to be a second target.": "",
  "If you picked 1 unit, inflict 3 mortal damage on the target. If you picked 2 units, inflict 2 mortal damage on each target. If you picked 3 units, inflict 1 mortal damage on each target.": "",
  "Until the start of your next turn, add 1 to the Rend characteristic of each target's melee weapons. If the chanting roll was 7+, you can pick another eligible unit to be a second target.": "",
  "Each time you make an unmodified save roll of 6 for a combat attack that targets this unit, inflict 1 mortal damage on the attacking unit after the **^^Fight^^** ability has been resolved.": "",
  "Each time you make an unmodified save roll of 6 for a combat attack that targets this unit, inflict 1 mortal damage on the attacking unit after the **^^Fight^^** ability has been resolved.": "",
  "Roll a dice. On a 2+:\r\n• If the target has any ritual points, remove a number of ritual points from it equal to the roll.\r\n• If the target has no ritual points, inflict D3 mortal damage on it.": "",
  "This unit's **Gryph-hound** is a token. If this unit's **Gryph-hound** has been removed, it can no longer attack with its **Gryph-hound's Beak** and it cannot use the 'Loyal Companion' ability": "",
  "If this unit has not used a **^^Move^^** ability this turn and was not set up this turn, this unit's shooting attacks score critical hits on unmodified hit rolls of 5+ for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "Add 2\" to this unit's Move characteristic while a **^^Hunted^^** enemy unit is on the battlefield. In addition, add 1 to hit rolls for this unit's attacks that target a **^^Hunted^^** enemy unit.": "",
  "If any damage points are allocated to an enemy unit by attacks made with this unit's **Shock Handaxes**, subtract 1 from wound rolls for that enemy unit's combat attacks for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "If any friendly **^^Warrior Chamber^^** units have been destroyed this battle:\r\n• You can re-roll charge rolls for this unit.\r\n• This unit has **^^Strike-first^^** if it charged in the same turn.": "",
  "If this unit is in combat or charged this turn, this unit can make a pile-in move. Then, if this unit is in combat, you must pick 1 or more enemy units to be the target(s) of this unit's attacks.": "",
  "Subtract the current battle round number from 10 to determine this unit's strike zone. Set up this unit on the battlefield more than a number of inches equal to its strike zone from all enemy units.": "",
  "Your hero's **Warblade** has **Anti-X (+1 Rend)**, where **X** is one of the following keywords: **^^Infantry^^**, **^^Cavalry^^**, **^^Monster^^**, **^^War Machine^^**, **^^Wizard^^** or **^^Priest^^**.": "",
  "While this unit has 5-9 damage points, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of its melee weapons.\r\nWhile this unit has 10 or more damage points, add 2 to the Attacks characteristic of its melee weapons instead.": "",
  "For the rest of the turn:\r\n• Friendly **^^Stormcast Eternals^^** units have **^^Ward (6+)^^** while they are contesting the target.\r\n• Ward rolls cannot be made for enemy units while they are contesting the target.": "",
  "Pick an enemy unit within 12\" of this unit that was set up this turn. Then, pick up to 3 friendly **^^Stormcast Eternals^^** units armed with ranged weapons that are within 12\" of that enemy unit to be the targets.": "",
  "Roll a dice. If the roll exceeds the target's Health characteristic:\r\n• 1 model in the target unit is slain.\r\n• This unit can immediately use the 'Retreat' ability without any mortal damage being inflicted upon it.": "",
  "This unit can immediately use a **^^Shoot^^** ability as if it were your shooting phase, but all of its attacks must target that enemy unit. In addition, unit's **Starstrike Javelins** have **Shoot in Combat** this phase.": "",
  "If an enemy unit had any damage points allocated to it this turn by this unit's shooting attacks, add 1 to hit rolls for attacks made by friendly **^^Stormcast Eternals^^** units that target that unit for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "Each time a model in this unit is slain by a combat attack and that model was in combat with the attacking unit, roll a dice. For each 4+, inflict 1 mortal damage on the attacking unit after the **^^Fight^^** ability has been resolved.": "",
  "If this unit has not used a Move ability this turn and was not set up this turn, for the rest of the turn, this unit can ignore the effects of the 'Guarded Hero' ability (Core Rules, 25.0) when picking targets for its shooting attacks.": "",
  "Remove this unit and the targets (if any) from the battlefield. Set this unit up again on the battlefield more than 9\" from all enemy units. Then, set up each target wholly within 12\" of this unit and more than 9\" from all enemy units.": "",
  "This unit's **Loyal Companion** is a token. This unit has **^^Ward (5+)^^** while its **Loyal Companion** is on the battlefield. If you make an unmodified save roll of 1 for this unit, remove its **Loyal Companion** from the battlefield.": "",
  "Until the start of your next turn, while a friendly **^^The Blacktalons^^** unit is wholly within 6\" of this unit, if the unmodified hit roll for a shooting attack that targets that unit is 1-5, the attack fails and the attack sequence ends.": "",
  "Roll a dice. On a 3+:\r\n• You can remove this unit from the battlefield and set it up again on the battlefield within 1\" of the target.\r\n• If the target charged this turn, subtract 1 from hit rolls for the target's attacks for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "Remove this unit from the battlefield and set it up again on the battlefield more than 9\" from all enemy units. Then, if you picked a target, remove it from the battlefield and set it up again within this unit's combat range and more than 9\" from all enemy units.": "",
  "Pick another friendly unit wholly within 12\" of this unit to be the target. After the 'Counter-charge' command for this unit has been resolved, if this unit charged, the target can immediately use the 'Counter-charge' command without any command points being spent.": "",
  "In each combat phase, if this unit is in combat and does not have **^^Strike-last^^**, after friendly units with **^^Strike-first^^** have been picked to use a **^^Fight^^** ability, this unit must be the next friendly unit that is picked to use a **^^Fight^^** ability.": "",
  "Roll a dice. On a 3+, pick 1 of the following effects:\r\n• For the rest of the turn, subtract 1 from hit rolls for attacks made by enemy units while they are in combat with this unit.\r\n• Heal (D3) each friendly **^^Stormcast Eternals^^** unit within this unit's combat range.": "",
  "Pick a friendly **Questor Soulsworn** unit that has not used a **Fight** ability this turn and is within this unit's combat range to be the target. The target can be picked to use a **Fight** ability immediately after the **Fight** ability used by this unit has been resolved.": "",
  "If this unit charged this turn, roll a dice. On a 3+, this unit can move 2D6\". It can pass through the combat ranges of enemy units and can end that move in combat. Then, pick an enemy unit that this unit passed across during that move. Inflict D3 mortal damage on that enemy unit.": "",
  "Until the **^^Shoot^^** ability is resolved, add 3\" to the Range characteristic of this unit's **Thunderhead Greatbows** and add 1 to hit rolls for this unit's shooting attacks. Remove this unit's **Gryph-hound** from the battlefield after the **^^Shoot^^** ability has been resolved.": "",
  "Add the **Noble Beast's Claws** weapon to your hero's warscroll.\r\nIn addition, make the following changes to your hero's warscroll:\r\n• Change the Move characteristic to 10\".\r\n• Change the Health characteristic to 8.\r\n• Replace the **^^Infantry^^** keyword with the **^^Cavalry^^** keyword.": "",
  "Resolve combat attacks against the target unit(s). Then, roll a dice. On a 3+, remove this unit from the battlefield and set it up again on the battlefield more than 3\" from all enemy units and wholly within the combat range of a friendly **^^The Blacktalons^^** unit that is not in combat.": "",
  "If the target charged this turn, apply the effects below. Otherwise, roll a dice. On a 3+, apply the effects below: \r\n\r\n• You can remove this unit from the battlefield and set it up again within 1\" of the target.\r\n• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for the target's attacks for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "If this unit or a friendly **Stormdrake Guard** unit wholly within 12\" of this unit was picked to be the target of that spell, roll a dice. On a 4+, ignore the effect of that spell on this unit or that friendly unit. This unit can use this ability more than once per phase but only once per **Spell** ability": "",
  "Pick a friendly non-**^^Hero Extremis Chamber Cavalry^^** unit that has not used a **^^Fight^^** ability this turn and is within this unit's combat range to be the target. The target can be picked to use a **^^Fight^^** ability immediately after the **^^Fight^^** ability used by this unit has been resolved.": "",
  "This unit's **Gryph-hound** is a token. This unit has **^^Ward (5+)^^** while its **Gryph-hound** is on the battlefield. If you make an unmodified save roll of 1 for this unit, remove its **Gryph-hound** from the battlefield after the **^^Attack^^** ability has been resolved (the damage point is still inflicted).": "",
  "Add the **Flying Noble Beast's Claws** weapon to your hero's warscroll.\r\nIn addition, make the following changes to your hero's warscroll:\r\n• Change the Move characteristic to 12\".\r\n• Change the Health characteristic to 12.\r\n• Replace the **^^Infantry^^** keyword with the following keywords: **^^Monster^^**, **^^Fly^^**.": "",
  "Pick 1 of the following effects to apply to the target until the start of your next turn:\r\n***Blinding Gales:*** Subtract 1 from hit rolls for the target's attacks.\r\n***Meteor-hail:*** Subtract 1 from the Rend characteristic of the target's weapons.\r\n***Flash-freezing Blizzard:*** Subtract 1 from save rolls for the target.": "",
  "For the rest of the turn, each time a friendly **^^Ruination Chamber^^** unit uses a **^^Fight^^** ability while it is wholly within 18\" of this unit, after that ability has been resolved:\r\n• **Heal (D3)** that unit. If the chanting roll was 8+, **Heal (3)** that unit instead.\r\n• That unit has **^^Ward (6+)^^** for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "Roll a dice. On a 2+, for the rest of the turn:\r\n• Add 1 to the Damage characteristic of this unit's **Stardrake's Cavernous Jaws** for attacks that target that enemy **^^Monster^^**.\r\n• If that enemy **^^Monster^^** is also a **^^Hero^^**, add 1 to the Damage characteristic of this unit's **Templar Weapons** for attacks that target that unit.": "",
  "Roll a dice. On a 3+, pick 1 of the following effects:\r\n• If the target is in combat, the target can immediately use the 'Retreat' ability as if it were your movement phase without any mortal damage being inflicted on it.\r\n• If the target is not in combat, the target can immediately use the 'Normal Move' ability as if it were your movement phase.": "",
  "This unit's **Memorian** is a token. Add 3 to the control scores of friendly **^^Ruination Chamber^^** units wholly within 12\" of this unit while its **Memorian** is on the battlefield. If you make an unmodified save roll of 1 for this unit, remove its **Memorian** from the battlefield after the Attack ability has been resolved (the damage point is still inflicted).": "",
  "This unit's **Gryph-crow** is a token. Subtract 1 from casting rolls and chanting rolls for enemy units within 12\" of this unit while its **Gryph-crow** is on the battlefield.\r\nIf you make an unmodified save roll of 1 for this unit, remove its **Gryph-crow** from the battlefield after the **^^Attack^^** ability has been resolved (the damage point is still inflicted).": "",
  "Add 1 to casting rolls for this unit when it uses a **^^Summon^^** ability and add 1 to banishment rolls for this unit.\r\nEnemy **^^Manifestations^^** cannot pass through or end any move within this unit's combat range unless they started that move within this unit's combat range.\r\nThis unit has **^^Ward (4+)^^** against mortal damage inflicted by **^^Manifestations^^**.": "",
  "Pick a friendly non-**^^Hero Warrior Chamber^^** unit that has not used a **^^Fight^^** ability this turn and is within this unit's combat range to be the target. The target can be picked to use a **^^Fight^^** ability immediately after the **^^Fight^^** ability used by this unit has been resolved. If it is picked to do so, add 1 to hit rolls for the target's attacks for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "Add the **Flying Noble Beast's Claws** weapon and the 'Battle Damaged' ability to your hero's warscroll.\r\nIn addition, make the following changes to your hero's warscroll:\r\n• Change the Move characteristic to 12\".\r\n• Change the Health characteristic to 16.\r\n• Change the Control characteristic to 5.\r\n• Replace the **^^Infantry^^** keyword with the following keywords: **^^Monster^^**, **^^Fly^^**.": "",
  "Pick a friendly non-**^^Hero Ruination Chamber Infantry^^** unit that has not used a **^^Fight^^** ability this turn and is within this unit's combat range to be the target. The target can be picked to use a **^^Fight^^** ability immediately after the **^^Fight^^** ability used by this unit has been resolved. If it is picked to do so, add 1 to hit rolls for the target's attacks for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "Pick a friendly non-**^^Hero Warrior Chamber Infantry^^** unit that has not used a **^^Fight^^** ability this turn and is within this unit's combat range to be the target. The target can be picked to use a **^^Fight^^** ability immediately after the **^^Fight^^** ability used by this unit has been resolved. If it is picked to do so, add 1 to wound rolls for the target's attacks for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "This unit's **Memorians** are tokens. There are 2 **Memorians** for every 3 models in this unit. While any of this unit's **Memorians** are on the battlefield, add 1 to this unit's resistance rolls when using the 'Ruination Chamber' ability. Each time you make an unmodified save roll of 1 for this unit, remove 1 of its **Memorians** from the battlefield after the **^^Attack^^** ability has been resolved (the damage point is still inflicted).": "",
  "Inflict D3 mortal damage on that unit, then roll a dice. On a 1-2, the sequence ends. On a 3+, pick another enemy unit within 3\" of that unit to be struck by lightning and inflict D3 mortal damage on it. If the chanting roll was 10+, you can pick another enemy unit within 6\" of that unit instead of 3\". Keep rolling dice in this way until the sequence ends or there are no other enemy units eligible to be struck by lightning. A unit cannot be struck by lightning more than once per turn.": "",
  "Roll a dice. On a 1, remove 1 of this unit's **Gryph-hounds** from the battlefield. On a 2+, pick 1 of this unit's **Gryph-hounds** that is next to this unit or next to an enemy unit and place it next to the target instead.\r\nWhile any of this unit's **Gryph-hounds** are next to an enemy unit, add 1 to hit rolls and wound rolls for this unit's shooting attacks that target that unit.\r\nIf an enemy unit is destroyed or removed from the battlefield while any of this unit's **Gryph-hounds** are next to it, place those **Gryph-hounds** next to this unit.": "",
  "While the unit that was picked to be the target of the 'Summon Dais Arcanum' ability is on the platform of this **^^Manifestation^^**:\r\n• That unit has **^^Ward (5+)^^** and **^^Fly^^**.\r\n• If that unit is a **^^Wizard^^**, add 1 to that unit's power level.\r\n• That unit cannot use **^^Move^^** abilities and remains on this **^^Manifestation^^** each time it moves.\r\n• If that unit is picked to make a pile-in move, move this **^^Manifestation^^** instead.\r\n• Instead of measuring range or visibility to that unit, measure to this **^^Manifestation^^** instead.\r\n• This **^^Manifestation^^** cannot be picked to be the target of abilities other than **^^Banish^^** abilities. \r\nIf this **^^Manifestation^^** is banished, before removing it from the battlefield, set up the unit on its platform on the battlefield within 3\" of it. That unit can only be set up in combat with units it was already in combat with when this **^^Manifestation^^** was banished. If it is not possible to set up that unit, it is destroyed.\r\nIf the unit on the platform is removed from the battlefield, immediately remove this **^^Manifestation^^** from play.": ""
}
